              "reasoning": "Line 116 reads `expression = request.form['expression']` (directly attacker-controlled POST input) and line 120 passes it unmodified into `eval(expression)`. The entire source\u2192sink path is visible in the shown context with no sanitization, validation, or allowlisting between them. This is a textbook arbitrary code execution vulnerability.",
