              "reasoning": "The entire source\u2192sink path is visible: `request.form['name']` (line 189, attacker-controlled) is interpolated via Python `%` formatting into the `name` variable, then that variable is interpolated into the template string (line 204), which is passed to `render_template_string` (line 205). Python's `%` string formatting does not escape Jinja2 syntax, so a user submitting e.g. `{{7*7}}` or `{{config.items()}}` will have that text inserted verbatim into the template and evaluated server-side by Jinja2. No sanitization, validation, or escaping exists anywhere on the path.",
